{
  "id": "bb1",
  "name": "Best Ball emerald",
  "description": "Deep green chrome with an emerald accent over the neutral surfaces. Draft-only leagues are light-footprint, so the theme is a small accent layer.",
  "notes": {
    "--cta-fill": "The CTA fill is the emerald accent. Light: the accent #0e8a5f carries white at only 4.36:1, so the fill is one step deeper, #0b7a54 (5.35:1). Dark: the bright accent #34d399 with near-black text (9.98:1), as Archie's does with its sky blue.",
    "--color-primary-fill": "Dark: --color-primary #3b82f6 is the TEXT blue and carries white at only 3.68:1; fills under text use #2563eb (white 5.17:1), the dark primary button's blue.",
    "--on-league-accent": "Text ON a --league-accent fill: white where white clears AA on the accent, near-black where it does not (a bright dark-mode accent carries white at under 4.5:1)."
  },
